\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Written values are retrieved through attention to their token, across the middle third of layers. (A)~Blocking later positions' attention to the edited value's token drops edit use to zero on four models; matched control blocks change nothing ($n{=}600$ per condition). (B)~Overwriting the hidden state at any single layer up to 22 redirects the answer; from layer 24 on it does nothing (Qwen3-4B, 36 layers, $n{=}60$). (C)~Blocking attention across layers 12 to 23 (shaded in both panels) removes 0.83 of edit use; no single layer's block matters (gray dots, $n{=}80$).}}{5}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:retrieval}{{4}{5}{Written values are retrieved through attention to their token, across the middle third of layers. (A)~Blocking later positions' attention to the edited value's token drops edit use to zero on four models; matched control blocks change nothing ($n{=}600$ per condition). (B)~Overwriting the hidden state at any single layer up to 22 redirects the answer; from layer 24 on it does nothing (Qwen3-4B, 36 layers, $n{=}60$). (C)~Blocking attention across layers 12 to 23 (shaded in both panels) removes 0.83 of edit use; no single layer's block matters (gray dots, $n{=}80$)}{figure.4}{}}
